{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51947","headline":"游灵显观 · 吕岩","name":"游灵显观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素衣丹壑寄生涯，相近衡茅共几家。\n卧听松音临水石，坐看山色老烟霞。\n林中有鹤窥来客，岩畔无人见落花。\n但把琴书消白昼，不须炉里炼丹砂。\n（同上三三五《潞安府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}